Perfect. We'll use a hybrid camera and make the first message a cinematic event, not an ordinary mobile notification.

Chapter 1 should feel deceptively normal. The player begins by controlling Harsha in an ordinary nighttime environment. The world gradually becomes quieter and more focused, until one simple message changes the mood. Nothing should immediately announce that she is inside a mystery.

# Prologue · Chapter 1: The Ordinary Night

Design direction selected

Date: February 13, 2027\
Starting time: 10:30 PM\
Core feeling: Familiarity → curiosity → subtle unease\
Chapter purpose: Establish normal life, introduce the first mystery, and make the player want to know what happens next.

The key design principle: let the player experience an ordinary night before the game starts behaving like a story.

