## 8. Complexity and implementation risk

| Feature                           | Complexity | Recommendation                                  |
| --------------------------------- | ---------- | ----------------------------------------------- |
| Third-person walking              | Medium     | Reuse existing character controller if possible |
| Smooth camera transitions         | Medium     | Use a camera director                           |
| Phone cinematic                   | Medium     | Timeline-based sequence                         |
| Phone screen UI                   | Easy       | 2D overlay attached to cinematic                |
| Character animation blending      | Medium     | Reuse existing animation clips                  |
| Moving car                        | Medium     | Spline-based path                               |
| Headlight and brake-light effects | Easy       | Three.js lighting and emissive materials        |
| Audio transitions                 | Easy       | Central audio controller                        |
| Cinematic scene transitions       | Medium     | Fade and state-machine control                  |

We should avoid expensive physics simulation for the car. A controlled path and a few animation states will be more reliable.

